Do you think it makes sense to move both &lt;tt&gt;SBLimitedLength&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;IdentityHashMap&lt;/tt&gt; into a single thread-local to make the code a bit cleaner?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
